{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_st02","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_st02","title":"僥倖離去","storyCode":"SV-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_st02.txt","sourceHash":"39d0a95c33fac851e3c93375eca9616a673c018c4cfd165802d334feaf881eb5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在審判官面前，凱爾希力保三位獵人，將她們送出鹽風城。回到羅德島的歌蕾蒂婭，卻發現異變正在發生。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生。請做出解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就知道事情沒那麼容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"比起伊比利亞人應該知道的那些，審判庭私藏的秘密已經太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"女士。在伊比利亞嚴禁傳謠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官閣下，因為你知道那些秘密我才這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"深海教會已經滲透進了伊比利亞，在伊比利亞隱秘地紮根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"利用你們和海洋曾經的聯繫，伊比利亞廢棄的城市成了深海教會向陸地伸出觸手的據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們闡釋你們的經書，歪曲你們的觀點，他們藏得很深，你們顧此失彼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......求救吧。再糾結國土和信仰間的淺薄紛爭，我們就會錯過最後的機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"獵人們和審判官與凱爾希奇怪地對峙著。斯卡蒂這時覺得，也許凱爾希真站在他們這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大審判官閣下，伊比利亞人是不同的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們每天看見的天際線都與大地上其他人不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼稱呼自己日夜生活的地方？——海邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人生活在陸上，而伊比利亞人生活在海邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"絕大多數人，不管他們是活在荒野還是活在城市，他們抬頭看見天空，平視卻只能看見一望無際的大地，山脈連綿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雲層上的一切與他們都無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他們所擁有的一切都只有“這片大地”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們把自己生活的地方叫作大地，是因為他們認定這世界除了陸地別無他物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"封閉的城邦，閉塞的村落，令人輕易喪命的荒野，他們除了自己能看見的，什麼都不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"再看看她們。她們，深海的獵人。阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"比這片陸地更廣大的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞與其他國家不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"陸地上的他們醉心於自己的航道與權力，忽視了無限的可能，忽視了他們本可以探索，卻盲目忽視的邊界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的世界完整得多。你們既瞭解陸地，又知曉海洋，伊比利亞對自己身處的位置有著最基礎的認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這讓你們在過去就已經領先了一大步立足於......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不必再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都過去了。城市的光輝散去，伊比利亞已經徒留廢墟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您讓我有些驚訝，閣下。我以為您會避而不談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在這，你不瞎。自己抬頭看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鹽風城這種城市，遍佈伊比利亞海岸。"},{"type":"narration","text":"曾經輝煌的伊比利亞，現在有多少這樣的遺跡？\n凱爾希知道，大審判官自然也知道。只是大審判官面如堅鐵，他的眉眼是一絲感情都不會流露出來的。\n加上現在，他戴著面具。\n如果能夠哭泣，伊比利亞人一定會號啕，如果能開心地笑，伊比利亞人一定會放聲大笑。\n但是，一個情感充沛的伊比利亞人，已經變成了面前這個樣子。\n沒有表情，沒有感情。伊比利亞的黃金時代自他們陷入寂靜的生命裡消失了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我們支援不了它們。許多城市自身難保。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"大靜謐後，伊比利亞已然不再。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你更需要其他人的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人知道伊比利亞發生何事。也不可以有人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因為伊比利亞曾經瀕臨毀滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"即使現在，伊比利亞也不能毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還在。伊比利亞的人民依然還在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，伊比利亞的人民即使一座城市也沒剩下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希望向三位深海獵人，其中，斯卡蒂正走向那些因為動靜而從建築中走出的居民，似乎要和他們說些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也不會輕易死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，聽我一言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"傲慢與偏見已經毀掉了阿戈爾人，這片土地不能重蹈海洋深處居民的覆轍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果伊比利亞也在這一場災難的餘波中倒下，這裡將再沒有人知道海洋的真實面貌與它威脅的可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就像凍原上百年一次的狩獵一樣，現在的我們也在衛護人類的疆土，而不是一國的榮辱，無論我們面對的是否是海中怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，如果伊比利亞只是像現在這樣苟延殘喘......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希看著大審判官的眼睛。大審判官的表情沒有任何變化，既不像是拒絕，也不像是允許。\n但凱爾希還是會把話說完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼伊比利亞終歸會毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的你們依然可以重建家園，重建伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我的目標，並不是要令你相信些什麼，閣下。我只是想讓你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這個回答，這個決定，不必由您給，也不用現在給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"鹽風城之事也得解決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大審判官環顧幾位獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人裡，至少有一個得留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，就像我們說好的那樣。我不在，就由你帶領他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大審判官，我是否有這個資格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以代受審問。我可以梳理來龍去脈。你能得到你需要的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我能忍受伊比利亞的牢獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你這麼堅持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你希望我把這幾個人驅逐出境？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"至少現在，是的。至少現在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"回羅德島。在伊比利亞東北邊境，Misery會接應你們。這回別走水路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"路線是審判庭指定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只要終點在那，其他我們都能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要多長時間才能回來？我可等不了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"她無權決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請勿擅自下結論，伊比利亞的鳥兒。監牢的圍牆於我和沙土無異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我該目送你被他押走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，獵人們。你們一定有很多事想和幽靈鯊說，清醒的她能給你們回答。她自己的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就沒有什麼話要對我說？這個機會可太難得了，對你也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我的建議不太適合你這樣的獵手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"嫌我性子急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那當然是因為你比我更清楚自己是什麼狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我不知道你現在的狀態能維持多久......但也許你已經不把這個當回事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"猜的。因為你心情愉快。現在的你一定覺得清醒與否對沒那麼重要，幽靈鯊。因為現在這樣，對你還算好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不用你說。我們什麼時候能一切都好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"如果現在再去想又睡下去怎麼辦，可太掃興了。我的標準比你低很多：只要不是徹底活成一團糟就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"而且啊，雖然我不喜歡說那些深海教會的鬼話，但那個也是我，我幹嘛要討厭自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"要辨別就讓聽我說話的人來傷腦筋吧，我只負責讓他們難堪不就好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的你是這樣的性子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧，凱爾希女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"何況我總算有些老朋友在身邊了，不再都是些我就算想講話都不知道該對他們講些什麼的人了。你知道，他們連海藻都沒見過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以教他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡，你現在可以回去的那個地方，還有許多你的新朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"未來，你的同僚們需要你。我也需要你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希說了些什麼。\n幽靈鯊笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別回來太晚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我一向準時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，獵人們。交給她了。她還算可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，二隊長，我還想和她說些話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次私自出動，斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，至少你聯繫了工程幹員，讓他們給了你這個箱子。他們立刻聯繫了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經做得比以前好太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到你真的會來幫助我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過的，“我言而有信”。無論你做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，回去羅德島，去享受一下假期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希看了斯卡蒂一眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她沒說什麼，但她笑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都有力所不及的事情，甚至連Dr.{@nickname}也束手無策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們擁有的技術尚不足以解決你的感染問題......你也不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但幽靈鯊，不能消滅它不意味著你沒法戰勝它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能消滅一個影子，但你可以與自己為友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的黑暗命運沒有解法......但你們可以與它並駕齊驅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許只有你們能與它搏鬥至末日。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，歌手，是你！你怎麼又回來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你的薩......薩克斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，沒關係，你一定是不小心弄丟在那裡了。我會幫你找找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你的琴，你昨天把琴落下了，我替你收著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"送給我......我們那個約定？這麼說，你真的找到你的同伴啦？真好，歌手，我好高興！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......你看上去更累了，比昨天晚上還要累。你受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......沒事。只是腦子有點暈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，你不在這裡，我還擔心你會有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才發生了很了不得的事情，你都看到了嗎？轟地一聲，又轟地一聲，砰砰砰，轟隆轟隆——前面那個山抖個不停，突然就塌啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為我們的房子也會跟著塌掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事哩。唯一的麻煩是，吃的都還在屋子裡，全部爛了。哎，又要餓一陣肚子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧審判官來了，她叫我們都離開房子，還不許我們靠近海岸和山上的教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她幫了你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。她可好了，一直守著我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗓子受傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——你、你你你這人！算了，不跟你計較。嘖，你竟然沒被長官抓走，算你運氣好，阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道你還會回來一趟......我有話跟你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不放棄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"什......你別這幅等著我打架的表情啊！我連劍都好好地放著沒拔出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我是想說，之前追著你不放，是我錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為我是那種......做錯了也不會道歉的人。雖然我是審判官......審判官犯錯，才更需要反省。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛進城的時候，我一下就發現了你。我知道你是阿戈爾人，無論你打扮成什麼樣子。你太不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我......我很氣憤。但是我也很激動。我以為我終於找到了問題的答案。邪惡的外來者、帶來厄運的罪魁禍首——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我把你揪出來，打敗你......我就能糾正錯誤、解決問題。多麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"但我打不過你。就算我能打敗你，又能改變什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"威脅著這座城市、威脅著伊比利亞的，不會是一個兩個阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你變化不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你功勞挺大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在沒辦法再像過去那樣思考。這裡發生的事讓我在某個時刻陷入了迷茫，甚至不確定自己該如何判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我是審判官。我理應替伊比利亞抹除威脅，守護秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——你是威脅，可你是敵人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這些人，他們是我要守護的，還是我要抹除的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我想不明白，我就不知道揮劍的意義。我將會失去前進的方向，跟這些人一樣，困在原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"後來——是你，你和這裡的居民，你們讓我看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人......我救不了他們。說來好笑，我是在明白這一點之後，才下定決心要保護他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在那一刻，這一刻，我知道什麼是對的，什麼是錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，你做的是好事。你確實保護了這裡......暫時。你做得比我好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做的是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做過的事情和你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼和我一樣......算了，你安慰人的方式和你喬裝打扮的技術一樣差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要安慰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼......不。別想了。我用不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你要找的答案，找到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也用不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題問得夠多了。真知道了答案，冷靜下來，發現也沒什麼。就跟你說的那樣，現在我明白自己該往哪裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？看來，我們都準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我要走了。我知道你也要走了，你仍能自由行動，一定是你們與長官達成了某項協定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們仍在追尋同一個結果，我們說不定還會在途中再撞上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，審判官走啦？好可惜，我還想讓她看看我在做的東西哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是歌手你教我的海藻酒呀！呃，是我做得不大對嗎？剁得還不夠碎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦咦咦？那我再試試，不要緊，吃的是沒了，剩下的海藻還挺多，大不了再從壁爐叔那裡拿一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會做好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"等做好了......唉，等做好了，歌手你早就走了吧？你過來，是不是就是要告訴我這個？你要走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我要離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"（下意識繼續搗了好幾下海藻）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你是流浪歌手哩。到處走，只偶爾停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你還會回到這裡嗎？我......還有佩特拉奶奶，牆灰，我們都還想聽你彈琴唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我的同伴，我們可以一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，那真是太好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們約好了，你可要記得早點回來呀！我會在這等著你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木框。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我在哩！歌手，他們找我有事，我要走啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"說好的，你可別忘了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......罐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅色貝殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮塔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就像她答應過的那樣，女孩停下腳步，回頭，對著斯卡蒂笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次遇見，如果是在外面，我也會為你唱歌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦！這麼看來，我可得把你的琴一塊放進盒子裡啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，再見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......該死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_13_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭用手摩挲著鏡子中自己的面龐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看你。最後還不是變成個醜八怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真該死在海溝裡。這就是你想要的？你真該和其他人一起死在那裡。你現在在這裡躲著，連呼吸都小心得很，連歌聲都不敢讓它們聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在一艘陸船的洗手間裡埋怨自己的遭遇......連洋流都乘不上。在這等著自己變成又一隻畜生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_13_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看。這就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太早了......太早了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大船......得找到大船。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣竟然想從斯卡蒂那裡得到答案......怪物們竟然想從兇手那裡得到真相。\n也就是說，獵人們還有機會。也許是唯一的機會——\n“它們的神沒有神諭。”\n在海浪滔天之前，在那些巨物呼喚它們的血脈之前，我們得把大海扼死在沉默裡。它的子嗣們將對此一無所知。\n我們去毀滅它們的源頭。\n只有這一個機會。即使這會帶來災難......阿戈爾也能得到喘息之機。\n我聽不見阿戈爾。呵，像不像那些怪物得不到啟示？\n但我們職責在身。深海獵人必須先其他人得到伊比利亞的秘密。\n——無可匹敵卻一夜消失的伊比利亞艦隊中，那最後一艘巨艦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭不再盯著鏡中的自己。\n我有責任。我必須衛護阿戈爾。\n奪下黃金的大船。拿到鑰匙。打開寶庫的大門。釋放火山。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["幽靈鯊"]}]}
